  "reading": "R2-OUT-V fires only when NO cell crosses anywhere in the grid. Given the frozen grid (top value 1.0), the frozen tau_var = 1e-3 and the frozen A draw, the smallest D_c reachable at lambda = 1 already exceeds tau_var at every cell. PREREG-1 6.1 calls this row 'live and not a straw man'; on these numbers it was unreachable before the run.",
